#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid "minacode reads a single TOML file, `~/.minacode/config.toml` by default. Generate a commented starter with `minacode --init-config`, or point at another file with `--config <path>`."
msgstr "minacode 默认读取 `~/.minacode/config.toml`。使用 `minacode --init-config` 生成带注释的初始配置，或通过 `--config <path>` 指定其他文件。"

#: ../../configuration.md:7
msgid "<span class=\"marker\">Only the `[provider]` block is required.</span> Every other key falls back to a built-in default, so a minimal config is just a provider. Inspect the resolved configuration at any time with `/config`."
msgstr "<span class=\"marker\">只有 `[provider]` 是必需的。</span>其他配置项都会使用内置默认值，因此最小配置只需一个 provider。随时可以用 `/config` 查看解析后的完整配置。"

#: ../../configuration.md:11
msgid "Provider selection"
msgstr "选择 provider"

#: ../../configuration.md:13
msgid "Define one or more `[provider.<name>]` blocks and select one with `[provider] active`:"
msgstr "定义一个或多个 `[provider.<name>]`，再通过 `[provider] active` 选择当前 provider："

#: ../../configuration.md:25
msgid "For provider fields, API protocols, live switching, reasoning, caching, strict tools, and documented compatibility behavior, see [Providers](providers.md)."
msgstr "Provider 字段、API 协议、实时切换、reasoning、缓存、strict tools 和有文档依据的兼容性行为，参见 [Provider](providers.md)。"

#: ../../configuration.md:28
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "Runtime"

#: ../../configuration.md:30
msgid "Optional; the defaults shown are used when omitted."
msgstr "以下设置均可省略，表中列出其默认值。"

