#~ msgid "For well-known hosts, `auto` settings pick sensible defaults for you, so <span class=\"marker\">`url`, `key`, and `model` are usually all you need</span>. Anything you set explicitly is always respected. Tested with DeepSeek, OpenCode, Alibaba Cloud, and ZenMux; other OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic endpoints work too."
#~ msgstr "对于已知 host，`auto` 会选择合理默认值，所以通常<span class=\"marker\">只需填写 `url`、`key` 和 `model`</span>。显式设置的值始终优先。已测试 DeepSeek、OpenCode、阿里云和 ZenMux；其他 OpenAI-compatible 与 Anthropic endpoint 也可以使用。"

#~ msgid "Switch providers within a session with `/provider [NAME]` and models with `/model [MODEL]`. See [Providers](providers.md) for every provider option, protocol selection, reasoning, prompt caching, strict tools, and the small set of documented compatibility profiles."
